Package: rcheckcanary
Type: Package
Title: Deliberately Undefined Behaviour for Verifying Check Flavors
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("docker-r-check", "contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "nobody@example.org")
Description: A test fixture, not a real package. It contains C code with
    deliberate undefined behaviour so that a sanitizer or valgrind flavor can
    be verified to actually detect something. A flavor that reports this
    package as clean is not instrumented, however convincing its output looks.
    Never submit this anywhere.
License: GPL-2
NeedsCompilation: yes
Encoding: UTF-8
